+# Version Scheme
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a version numbering scheme. The crates currently share a single workspace version (`0.1.0` in `Cargo.toml`), but no policy document, ADR, or other recorded decision specifies the rules governing how that number (or any other version identifier used by the project) should be incremented or interpreted.
